ubUrl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>代码主页</span><b>查看公开项目</b><i>↗</i></a><a v-if="about.resumeUrl" :href="about.resumeUrl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>个人简历</span><b>打开 PDF 文档</b><i>↓</i></a></div></section></div></div></template></main></template>
